# Line endings are LF in the index and in the worktree, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true writes CRLF into the
# worktree: `.editorconfig` only asks editors for LF, and Prettier's default
# (endOfLine: "lf") then fails `npm run format:check` on every file, while a
# line-ending-only change shows up as a whole-file diff. Git obeys this file, not
# .editorconfig.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never convert anything detected as binary.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
